\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30004807 (OWR-8415343-010). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Mathematical Aspects of General Relativity (2021), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2021/40, pp. 2157--2267. Original report and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2021/40}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30004807}

